message: "If you use SionnaRTStudio in your research, please cite the software using the metadata below."
title: "SionnaRTStudio: A Browser-Based Wireless Digital Twin"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tarafder"
    given-names: "Pulok"
    affiliation: "Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science, Howard University"
version: 1.0.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22064926"
date-released: 2026-08-23
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/puloktarafder/SionnaRTStudio"
url: "https://github.com/puloktarafder/SionnaRTStudio"
abstract: >-
  SionnaRTStudio is a browser-based wireless digital twin built on NVIDIA
  Sionna RT, with an interactive React and Three.js frontend and a FastAPI
  backend for ray-traced wireless propagation analysis.
keywords:
  - wireless digital twin
  - ray tracing
  - radio propagation
  - Sionna RT
  - Three.js
  - FastAPI
